B.baA=new A.fe("c1","First Light","Power up with a Generator, bridge to a deposit with a Relay, then drop an Extractor on it. Mine 200.",0,1,200,0,260,1,16,900,640,B.Ld,4,"A Generator makes power; only RELAYS carry it onward. If a deposit is past the core's reach, drop a Relay to bridge the gap, then an Extractor on the rock to mine it.")
B.bav=new A.fe("c2","Reaching Out","The ore is out of reach. Drop a Relay between the core and a far deposit, then mine 320.",0,1,320,0,240,7,16,1120,780,B.Ld,2,"Only RELAYS carry power onward \u2014 they are the bridges. The core is the heart; everything else (Generators, Cells, Extractors, turrets) just DRAWS from a Relay or the core in range. Chain Relays to reach far deposits, and upgrade a Relay to stretch its reach even farther.")
B.bai=new A.fe("c3","The Long Line","Ore sits far out. Chain relays across the field and haul 480 minerals home.",0,1,480,0,240,15,24,1360,900,B.Ld,-1,"Long runs need several relays in a chain \u2014 each one hands power to the next. Plan the route before you spend on extractors.")
B.a0e=s([1,4,2,5],t.t)
B.ba7=new A.fe("c4","First Contact","Raiders inbound. Ring the core with Lasers and hold 3 waves.",0,0,3,3,300,22,16,1120,780,B.a0e,5,"A Laser auto-fires at any raider in range \u2014 place a few around the core. Turrets need power too, so keep them wired to the grid.")
B.baf=new A.fe("c5","Hard Cases","Breakers target your modules, not the core. Layer your Lasers and survive 4 waves.",0,0,4,4,320,30,18,1200,820,B.a0e,-1,"Breakers are slow and tough and chew your buildings. Put lasers where they can cover your extractors and each other.")
B.a7P=s([1,4,2,5,3],t.t)
B.bat=new A.fe("c6","Prospector","Dig under harassment. Add a Cell so your guns never run dry, and mine 650.",0,1,650,0,280,38,22,1300,860,B.a7P,3,"A Cell banks spare power for busy moments. With a cell wired in, your lasers keep firing when a wave hits all at once.")
B.bag=new A.fe("c7","Power Surge","Heavier waves now. Bank energy between waves and spend it holding 5 waves.",0,0,5,5,320,46,18,1200,820,B.a7P,-1,"A full cell is a buffer against a surge. Let it charge in the quiet, and your guns won't stutter when the wave lands.")
B.a6L=s([1,4,2,5,3,6],t.t)
B.baj=new A.fe("c8","Swarm","Darts come in numbers. Add fast-firing Pulsers to shred the swarm and hold 5 waves.",0,0,5,5,340,54,18,1240,840,B.a6L,6,"A Pulser fires much faster than a laser \u2014 perfect for clouds of little darts. Mix pulsers in where the swarm is thickest.")
B.ba3=new A.fe("c9","Deep Dig","Fund guns AND extractors at once. Keep the lode flowing and reach 1000.",0,1,1000,0,300,62,26,1380,920,B.a6L,-1,"Every mineral spent on a gun is one not spent on an extractor. Grow income first, then reinvest it into defence \u2014 and repeat.")
B.a20=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7],t.t)
B.bay=new A.fe("c10","Cutting Beam","Fit a long-range Beam and let it burn. Mine 700 while it holds the field.",0,1,700,0,360,70,22,1300,860,B.a20,7,"The Beam is a continuous ray with long reach \u2014 it melts a target over time. It's power-hungry, so keep a Cell nearby.")
B.baE=new A.fe("c11","Torus Packs","Torus ships shrug off beams. Fall back on Lasers and Pulsers and hold 6 waves.",0,0,6,6,360,78,18,1300,860,B.a20,-1,"A Torus barely feels your Beam \u2014 bullets do the work here. Keep lasers and pulsers ready for when the toruses roll in.")
B.fU=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8],t.t)
B.bad=new A.fe("c12","Long Reach","Unlock the Lance \u2014 huge damage at long range. Mine 900 while lances cover you.",0,1,900,0,400,86,24,1420,940,B.fU,8,"Lances hit hard from far away \u2014 but not point-blank. Put them BEHIND your lasers so close-in raiders never reach them.")
B.bax=new A.fe("c13","Frontier Lines","Spread out and defend the whole grid. Hold supply and guns across 6 waves.",0,0,6,6,380,94,26,1480,980,B.fU,-1,"A long supply line is a long thing to defend. Guard the relays and extractors out on the frontier, not only the core.")
B.baw=new A.fe("c14","Last Redoubt","Cramped and exposed \u2014 no room to spread. Build a tight, layered fort and outlast 7 waves.",0,0,7,7,380,102,12,1000,720,B.fU,-1,"With no space to spread, stack your defences in layers: pulsers up front, lances and beams behind. Overlap their coverage.")
B.bar=new A.fe("c15","Deep Vein","Strip a rich lode while torus packs press in. Guns up, extractors running \u2014 reach 1600.",0,1,1600,0,360,110,28,1460,960,B.fU,-1,"Toruses return every few waves \u2014 keep a wall of bullets standing, not just a beam. Your income has to outpace your repairs.")
B.bak=new A.fe("c16","Siege","A Colossus leads the horde. Concentrate lances and heavy fire, and hold 8 waves.",0,0,8,8,440,118,22,1400,920,B.fU,-1,"The Colossus is slow but soaks enormous damage \u2014 focus lances and beams on it while lasers and pulsers clear its escort.")
B.ba8=new A.fe("c17","Hold the Vein","Mine deep while the threat peaks. Never stop producing \u2014 reach 2000.",0,1,2000,0,400,126,30,1500,1000,B.fU,-1,"A long dig will outlast several waves, boss included. Defend the extractors you have before you rush to build more.")
B.ba5=new A.fe("c18","The Long Haul","A vast field, everything at once. Hold supply and defence across 10 waves.",0,0,10,10,420,134,34,1580,1060,B.fU,-1,"Big maps mean many fronts and a big grid to power. Cells and relays keep distant guns fed \u2014 don't let an edge go dark.")
B.bam=new A.fe("c19","Twin Veins","Two rich fields, two fronts to hold. Work both and reach 2600.",0,1,2600,0,420,142,32,1540,1020,B.fU,-1,"Two mining fronts double your income and your exposure. Give each its own ring of guns rather than one big pile in the middle.")
B.baa=new A.fe("c20","Gauntlet","No soft waves left. Everything you have, holding the line for 12 waves.",0,0,12,12,460,150,24,1420,940,B.fU,-1,"From here on every wave bites. Repair and re-arm in the breathers and call the next wave early only when you're truly ready.")
B.bas=new A.fe("c21","Lean Times","Little to start, ore far out, waves already hard. Mine your way up to 2200.",0,1,2200,0,240,158,28,1480,980,B.fU,-1,"A lean start punishes waste \u2014 sell what you misplace and reinvest. One good extractor, well defended, beats three you can't protect.")
B.ba4=new A.fe("c22","Citadel","Turn a small field into a fortress. Layer every weapon and hold 12 waves.",0,0,12,12,460,166,14,1040,740,B.fU,-1,"In a killbox, every shot should overlap. Front-line pulsers, mid lasers, back-line lances and beams \u2014 funnel them all through it.")
B.ba6=new A.fe("c23","Mother Lode","The richest seam in the field, and they want it too. Strip it for 3200.",0,1,3200,0,420,174,34,1560,1040,B.fU,-1,"At full tilt your income funds a moving front of guns. Push extractors outward as you clear space, and never let the grid brown out.")
B.bap=new A.fe("c24","War of Attrition","A long, grinding siege \u2014 toruses and a boss both. Endure 14 waves.",0,0,14,14,480,182,26,1500,1000,B.fU,-1,"Endurance is economy: replace losses as fast as they fall. Keep a mineral cushion so a bad wave never leaves you unable to rebuild.")
B.ba_=new A.fe("c25","Double Trouble","Two Colossi across the siege, toruses between. Hold the core for 16 waves.",0,0,16,16,520,190,24,1440,960,B.fU,-1,"Two bosses means two moments everything must focus one target. Bank lances and energy ahead of each so you can burst it down.")
B.bah=new A.fe("c26","Last Stand","Everything you have learned, all at once. Raise a fortress and survive 18 waves.",0,0,18,18,560,198,22,1360,920,B.fU,-1,"This is the exam \u2014 power, supply, and every weapon, together. Build deep, defend the tether, and focus the bosses. Good luck.")
B.biU=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9],t.t)
B.ban=new A.fe("c27","Chokepoint","Shape the field. Wall off the gaps to funnel raiders into your guns, and hold 8 waves.",0,0,8,8,480,206,20,1380,920,B.biU,9,"A Wall costs almost nothing, needs no power, and drops instantly. It won't fire \u2014 it blocks and soaks, funneling enemies onto your turrets.")
B.bgG=s([1,4,2,5,3,6,7,8,9,15],t.t)
B.ba1=new A.fe("c28","Locust Swarm","Swarmers arrive in clouds. Add spread-firing Flak Cannons to shred them and hold 9 waves.",0,0,9,9,500,214,20,1400,940,B.bgG,15,"A Flak Cannon throws three bolts at once \u2014 ideal against Swarmers, the tiny ships that come in packs. Put flak where the cloud is thickest.")
