B.cvU=new A.d1("priolanes",'A three-lane prioritization view over a table\'s status column: Now (active), Pending (queued), Future (discussed). `done` rows and `excludeTypes` rows are hidden \u2014 a forward-looking view, not a full log. Optional project grouping walks CONTAINS edges (same generic edgesTable/edgeFrom/edgeTo/edgeType/containsType idiom as `explorer`/`entrythread`) up to the nearest ancestor whose type equals `projectType`. Drag a card between lanes (wide) or use its \u22ee "Move to\u2026" menu (any width) to rewrite its status through the normal write path.',B.bmm,!1)
B.cTD=new A.p("table",B.at,"Table the nodes live in (default entries).",B.f,null)
B.cIF=new A.p("scopeColumn",B.t,"Opt-in ENGINE scope filter (see `BoardState.rowsForScoped`), only applied to `roots:true` whole-graph mode: root rows are drawn only from `table` rows in the board's currently active scope for (table, scopeColumn) \u2014 the same convention `bubl`/`canvas` read via `activeScope`, so an Outline scoped to the same column as a sibling `bubl`/`canvas` on the same table agrees with them on which rows are in play. Absent (default): unchanged \u2014 every row in `table` mixes at the top level regardless of any ancestor scope.",B.f,null)
