B.cPS=new A.p("cluster",B.W,"Opt-in zoom-aware grid clustering of pins (default off = every row renders its own marker, unchanged). Groups nearby pins into count-badge clusters that split apart as the map zooms in \u2014 keeps a large table (e.g. thousands of geocoded rows) smooth at a zoomed-out view instead of rendering one widget per row.",B.f,null)
B.cRN=new A.p("spiderfyThreshold",B.af,"A cluster badge with at most this many members SPIDERFIES on tap (fans its pins out on short legs, each individually tappable) instead of glide-zooming in \u2014 default 4. Only used with cluster:true. Larger clusters still glide-zoom in as before.",B.f,null)
B.cWg=new A.p("markerPulse",B.W,"Opt-in gentle breathing highlight (repeating opacity pulse, ~1s period) on every visible non-clustered pin \u2014 default off = today's plain pin rendering, unchanged. Purely visual: tap targets, spiderfy and detailPopup are unaffected. Pairs with `databars`' `play` for a \"time wave\" read (the strip sweeps, only that slot's pins show, and they breathe).",B.f,null)
B.cUy=new A.p("userLocation",B.W,"Show a locate-me button and the user's current position on the map. Opt-in.",B.f,null)
