B.cYQ=new A.p("showProvenance",B.W,'Show a small read-only "source \xb7 fetched <relative time>" caption above the tile, drawn from the engine-internal provenance envelope auto-stamped by `importData`/`http` when they last landed rows in `table`. Unset = no caption, byte-identical render.',B.f,null)
