B.cvR=new A.d1("splitbar","A standalone slim two-segment proportion bar (accent=part, muted=exclusive/remainder) bound to a SINGLE row \u2014 the non-list twin of cards' per-row `splitBar` prop, for a topic/summary-level shared-vs-exclusive bar a `cards` list can't express (e.g. Topic screen's overall synergy bar, or a per-layer L1/L2 breakout). Same visual and \"part/total label\" convention as cards' splitBar \u2014 numbers from data, words from a static localized `label` map, never mixed into stored data.",B.bxT,!1)
