B.cN1=new A.p("iconMode",B.W,'Icon-authoring aids on the (already-square) canvas: a rule-of-thirds + centre-cross guide overlay, a live ~32px corner preview, and an "Export icon set" menu entry bundling PNGs at 16\u20131024px plus one full-size PNG into a .zip.',B.f,"Icon mode")
