B.cIq=new A.p("emptyHome",B.W,'With nothing selected, render a landing Home (new-file actions + recent files) instead of the "select a file" placeholder. Opening and creating are both optional \u2014 nothing auto-opens or auto-creates. startBlank takes precedence when both are set.',B.f,"Show a Home when nothing is open")
